  <p class="mini" id="downloadProfile" style="margin-top: 12px;">
    The signed profile will be hosted at <code>/aegis-dot.mobileconfig</code> when published. Until then, configure manually:
    in <strong>Settings</strong> → <strong>General</strong> → <strong>VPN, DNS &amp; Device Management</strong>, choose <strong>DNS</strong> and enter the DoT hostname: <strong>{{ site.endpoints.dotHost }}</strong>.
  </p>
</section>

<section class="card" id="routers" style="margin-top: 16px;">
  <h3 class="section-title">Routers</h3>
  <p>If your router supports encrypted DNS, set it once and every device on the network is covered.</p>
  <ul class="list">
    <li>DoT upstream: <strong>{{ site.endpoints.dotHost }}</strong>, port <strong>{{ site.endpoints.dotPort }}</strong></li>
    <li>DoH upstream: <strong>{{ site.endpoints.doh }}</strong></li>
    <li>If your firmware exposes DoQ, point it to <strong>{{ site.endpoints.doqHost }}</strong> on port <strong>{{ site.endpoints.doqPort }}</strong>.</li>
  </ul>
  <p class="mini">OpenWrt, Ubiquiti EdgeOS, MikroTik, AsusWRT-Merlin, and pfSense / OPNsense all support at least DoT.</p>
</section>

<section class="card" id="browsers" style="margin-top: 16px;">
  <h3 class="section-title">Browsers</h3>
  <p>Browser-level DNS-over-HTTPS only protects that browser's traffic — other apps still use the system resolver.</p>
  <ol class="steps">
    <li>Open your browser's privacy settings.</li>
    <li>Find the <strong>DNS over HTTPS</strong> section.</li>
    <li>Choose <strong>Custom</strong> and paste:</li>
  </ol>
  <div class="mono">DoH URL: {{ site.endpoints.doh }}</div>
</section>

<section class="card" id="verify" style="margin-top: 16px;">
  <h3 class="section-title">Live verification</h3>
  <p>Run real DNS-over-HTTPS queries from this page against the resolver. No data leaves your browser.</p>

  <div class="endpoint">
    <div class="label">
      <span>DoH endpoint under test</span>
      <span class="badge">read-only</span>
    </div>
    <div class="mono" id="verifyDohUrl">{{ site.endpoints.doh }}</div>
    <div class="mono" id="blockHost" style="margin-top: 6px;">{{ site.endpoints.blockTestHost }}</div>
  </div>

  <div class="statusline">
    <span class="pill"><span class="led" id="vLed"></span><span id="vStatus">Idle</span></span>
  </div>

  <div class="btnrow">
    <button class="btn primary" type="button" onclick="verifyAll()">Run all checks</button>
    <button class="btn" type="button" onclick="verifyReachability()">Reachability</button>
    <button class="btn" type="button" onclick="verifyBinaryExample()">DoH query (google.com)</button>
    <button class="btn" type="button" onclick="verifyBlockTest()">Block test</button>
    <button class="btn" type="button" onclick="clearVerify()">Reset</button>
  </div>

  <div class="grid3" style="margin-top: 16px;">
    <div class="tile">
      <h3>Reachability</h3>
      <p><strong id="rReach">Not run</strong></p>
      <p class="mini" id="dReach"></p>
    </div>
    <div class="tile">
      <h3>DoH query</h3>
      <p><strong id="rBin">Not run</strong></p>
      <p class="mini" id="dBin"></p>
      <p class="mini" id="dBinExtra"></p>
    </div>
    <div class="tile">
      <h3>Block test</h3>
      <p><strong id="rBlock">Not run</strong></p>
      <p class="mini" id="dBlock"></p>
      <p class="mini" id="dBlockExtra"></p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p class="mini" id="vSummary" style="margin-top: 10px;"></p>
</section>
